{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>They shall be holy to their Elohim</b> — Holiness is separateness, as I explained in the preceding section (Ramban on Leviticus 19:2). He says that even in what is permitted to Israel, the priests shall be separated — they shall distinguish themselves from the impurity of the dead and from marriages with women who are not fit for them, in purity and in cleanliness."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:57:09.708736737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}